    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d701">

                <pb facs="0672" n="582" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg582"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.51/244</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Tiflis</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Smith</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-11-26T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 26,
                                1917, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram November 23 and previous telegrams. Please advise how under
                    circumstances you describe the financial support you propose will not tend to
                    encourage sectionalism or disruption of Russia or civil war. Department cannot
                    encourage tendencies in any of these directions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
